{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120124759555-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120131748\"/><p>人員在順豐圍截查一輛私家車。</p><p>今日(20日)早上10時許，執法人員在屯門順豐圍截查一輛私家車，警員在車廂內檢獲多個車牌，經調查後相信，司機涉及區內多次瘋狂駕駛，人員隨即將該名年約50歲男子拘捕，帶署作進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.693888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:47:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.457544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:26.715464+00:00","content_hash":"390f52ca2ad40a0d82fbe1b4e081803cbd22ae12a8eef3410a77d282cfbabd46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.693888+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}